2b:["$","$L2d",null,{"post":{"id":"p_darkroom-verification-philosophy","slug":"darkroom-verification-philosophy","title":{"en":"Why Darkroom Publishes No Popularity Numbers","ne":"डार्करूमले लोकप्रियता सङ्ख्या किन देखाउँदैन"},"excerpt":{"en":"A resource list ranked by clicks rewards whoever marketed hardest, not whoever is most useful.","ne":"क्लिकका आधारमा क्रमबद्ध सूचीले सबैभन्दा बढी प्रचार गर्नेलाई पुरस्कृत गर्छ, सबैभन्दा उपयोगीलाई होइन।"},"content":{"en":"A resource list ranked by clicks rewards whoever marketed hardest, not whoever is most useful. Darkroom takes a different position.\n\n## Discover → Verify → Organize → Access\n\nEvery important resource carries: what it is, why it is useful, who it is for, where it leads, official status, pricing type and review status. That is more work than a link list, and it is the point.\n\n## Why popularity stays private\n\nPublic view counts create feedback loops. A resource that is already ahead gets clicked more, ranks higher and pushes better alternatives down. Acttolog keeps usage signals inside Acttolog Intelligence where they inform maintenance — detecting broken links and stale reviews — instead of steering public attention.\n\n## Status labels instead of stars\n\nOfficial · Verified · Needs Review · Broken · Suspicious. No star ratings, no public written reviews, no trending badges.\n\n> If a resource deserves attention, the reason should be written down.","ne":"क्लिकका आधारमा क्रमबद्ध सूचीले सबैभन्दा बढी प्रचार गर्नेलाई पुरस्कृत गर्छ, सबैभन्दा उपयोगीलाई होइन। डार्करूमले फरक बाटो लिन्छ।\n\n## खोज → प्रमाणीकरण → व्यवस्थापन → पहुँच\n\nहरेक महत्त्वपूर्ण स्रोतसँग हुन्छ: यो के हो, किन उपयोगी छ, कसका लागि हो, कहाँ पुर्‍याउँछ, आधिकारिक स्थिति, मूल्य प्रकार र समीक्षा स्थिति।\n\n## तारा होइन, स्थिति लेबल\n\nआधिकारिक · प्रमाणित · समीक्षा आवश्यक · बिग्रिएको · शंकास्पद।"},"cover":"art:editorial","author":"Acttolog Editorial","category":"Media","tags":["darkroom","trust"],"publishedAt":"2026-08-19","updatedAt":"","status":"published","access":"public","audience":"global","featured":false,"seoTitle":"Why Darkroom Publishes No Popularity Numbers | Acttolog","seoDescription":"A resource list ranked by clicks rewards whoever marketed hardest, not whoever is most useful.","socialImage":""}}]
